@startuml
participant Sales
database sales_db
participant Publisher
queue RabbitMQ
participant Consumer
database report_db
Sales -> sales_db : COMPLETED + outbox (one transaction)
Publisher -> sales_db : poll PENDING
Publisher -> RabbitMQ : persistent event
RabbitMQ --> Publisher : publisher confirm
Publisher -> sales_db : mark SENT
RabbitMQ -> Consumer : deliver
Consumer -> report_db : processed_events + facts (one transaction)
report_db --> Consumer : commit
Consumer -> RabbitMQ : ACK
@enduml
